Package: hyperloom
Type: Package
Title: CTTIR Hyperspectral Imaging Suite
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Provides an installation framework for the CTTIR hyperspectral
    imaging suite. It declares 'hyperspectR', 'hyperspectaculR', 'cuvis.r' and
    'tivis.r' as required dependencies so that package installers resolve and
    install the suite and its required R dependencies. It provides no analysis
    functions and does not attach the member packages. Instrument software and
    optional backends are configured through the individual packages.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/hyperloom
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/hyperloom/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    hyperspectR,
    hyperspectaculR,
    cuvis.r,
    tivis.r
Additional_repositories: https://cttir.r-universe.dev
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
